<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 200 mln 1-yr bonds on April 23.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 200 mln 1-yr bonds on April 23.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will hold a 200 million zloty tender of one-year index-linked bonds on April 23, the central bank said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 11:00 (0900 GMT)</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - April 29, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bonds offered - June 4, 1998</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
